#   申申  shēn shēn — easy, relaxed in bearing (Yang Shi, quoted by Zhu Xi: 其容舒也; Ma Rong: 和舒之貌) (7.4)
#   夭夭  yāo yāo — cheerful, pleasant in countenance (Yang Shi, quoted by Zhu Xi: 其色愉也) (7.4)
#   三軍  sān jūn — the three armies: the whole host of a great state (Zhu Xi: 萬二千五百人為軍，大國三軍) (7.10)
#
# Characters:
#   述 shù — to hand on, to transmit (Zhu Xi: 傳舊)      竊 qiè — privately, presuming (humble); to steal
#   彭 péng — Peng (in 老彭)                              黙 mò — = 默 (edition's form): silent, silently
#   識 zhì — to remember, keep in mind (Zhu Xi: 音志，記也); read shí 'to know'   [suggest POLY]
#   倦 juàn — to weary, tire                               修 xiū — to cultivate, to put in order
#   講 jiǎng — to go over, discuss, make clear            徙 xǐ — to move, shift (toward)
#   燕 yàn — at ease, at leisure (燕居)                    夭 yāo — gentle, cheerful (夭夭)
#   甚 shèn — extreme, very                                衰 shuāi — to decline, grow feeble
#   夣 mèng — = 夢 (edition's form): to dream; a dream    據 jù — to hold fast to (Zhu Xi: 執守之意)
#   依 yī — to rely on, not depart from (Zhu Xi: 不違)     脩 xiū — dried meat (Zhu Xi: 脯也); 束脩 a bundle of ten strips
#   憤 fèn — to strain to understand (Zhu Xi: 心求通而未得)  啓 qǐ — = 啟: to open (Zhu Xi: 開其意)
#   悱 fěi — to struggle for words (Zhu Xi: 口欲言而未能)   隅 yú — a corner
#   側 cè — side; beside                                    哭 kū — to wail (in mourning)
#   歌 gē — to sing                                         藏 cáng — to store away; to withdraw, keep hidden   [suggest POLY: zàng]
#   軍 jūn — an army (12,500 men, Zhu Xi)                   暴 bào — to attack bare-handed (暴虎, Zhu Xi: 徒搏)
#   虎 hǔ — tiger                                           馮 píng — to wade (馮河, Zhu Xi: 皮冰反，徒涉); Féng, a surname   [suggest POLY]
#   河 hé — the (Yellow) River                              鞭 biān — whip
#   肉 ròu — meat                                           味 wèi — taste
#   圖 tú — to plan; to expect, imagine (不圖)              衞 wèi — = 衛 (edition's form): Wei, a state
#   諾 nuò — yes (assent; Zhu Xi: 應辭)                     飯 fàn — to eat (Zhu Xi: 食之也); cooked rice
#   曲 qū — to bend; bent   [suggest POLY: qǔ 'song']      肱 gōng — the forearm, the arm
#   枕 zhěn — to pillow the head on (Zhu Xi: 去聲 zhèn); a pillow   雲 yún — cloud
#   雅 yǎ — constantly, regularly (Zhu Xi: 常也); correct, standard (Kong Anguo: 雅言，正言)
#
# Broaden by addition (sense used here):
